      brief: "The condo association at the 239-unit Palm Beach Marriott Singer Island is seeking punitive damages and a freeze on fees charged by hotel owner Urgo Hotels; its lawyer says fees charged since 2013 could top $45 million. Trial is set for early 2027.",
