      title: "South Union Township v. Namdar Realty Group & Uniontown Mall Realty (Court-Supervised Mall Safety Compliance)",
      brief: "South Union Township's suit led a Fayette County judge to order Namdar Realty to fix blocked exits, vermin and crumbling roads at Uniontown Mall; she set a Sept. 30 site visit, the Herald-Standard reported.",
