      summary: "American Hospitality Properties REIT, Inc., American Hospitality Properties REIT II, Inc. and 14 affiliated entities filed voluntary Chapter 11 petitions on October 4, 2026 in the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the Northern District of Texas (No. 26-80071), WhatNow reported, citing PACER records. The chief restructuring officer signed the petition, and the REITs retained Vinson & Elkins as counsel and FTI Consulting as financial advisor. The filing follows a June 2026 SEC action, settled without admission, against the REITs' former external manager, Phoenix American Hospitality, LLC, and its president, and a September 2026 investor suit over the same offerings.",
