      seoTitle: "Shadowbox Studios Sues DeKalb Over Data Center Moratorium",
      seoDescription: "Shadowbox Studios and Henrico 183 sued DeKalb County, Georgia, saying its data-center moratorium blocks a project county staff had told them was allowed.",
      title: "Shadowbox Studios, LLC v. DeKalb County, Georgia (Data Center Moratorium Takings Suit)",
      brief: "Shadowbox Studios sued DeKalb County, Georgia, saying its data center moratorium blocks a project on a nearly 200-acre site that planning staff said was allowed and cut the land's value by $200 million.",
      category: "zoning-land-use",
      status: "filed",
