      brief: "JBG Smith agreed to pay $8.1 million and Mid-America Apartments $1.2 million to resolve the D.C. Attorney General's claims that they used RealPage software to coordinate apartment rents, without admitting liability.",
      category: "landlord-tenant",
      status: "settled",
      date: "2026-09-14",
