      brief: "An SL Green special servicing unit has sued to foreclose on 1440 Broadway, the 745,000-square-foot Times Square office building owned by StepStone and anchored by Amazon, over a $399 million CMBS loan, The Real Deal reported, citing Crain's.",
      category: "lending-foreclosure",
      status: "filed",
